  "details": "Stuff I'd love to see for vrchat users especially those who use potatoes to play (I always get 11 frames x.x)\n\nWorld's\nAbility to disable parts of worlds that cause lag\n\nAbility to search for worlds within a certain size. \n\nPeople\nI always have to keep avatars blocked, maybe change the friends block avatar to a different color so it's easier to see them.\n\nFriends list\nMake it so you can block/unblock avatars and features from the social menu instead of clicking them\n\nSomething that would be nice\n\nIf you see someone with an avatar you liked, and it was from a world you can eaislg join that world or use that avatar just by clicking on the person",
